{"aliases":["SPRT","Sequential Probability Ratio Test","序贯概率比检验"],"external_ids":{},"history":[{"agent":"claude-code","at":"2026-11-10T08:39:06.055611+00:00","fields":["id","how","why","kind","name","slug","what","layer","props","status","name_zh","summary","created_at","importance","tracked_at","expanded_at","merged_into","occurred_at","created_by_run"],"intent":"seed: robotics skills & eval harness nodes (Action Chunking, SAM 3, AnyGrasp, Wall-X, lmms-eval, lm-eval-harness, RoboCasa) + statistical methods used in LLM evaluation (group testing, SPRT, FDR/BH, winner's curse, prediction-powered inference)","op":"insert","reason":"新节点","run_id":"r_20261110_3r2w5e"}],"node":{"created_at":"2026-11-10T08:39:06.055611+00:00","created_by_run":"r_20261110_3r2w5e","expanded_at":null,"how":null,"id":"n_01m729rs3rj0khsdcg","importance":3,"kind":"method","layer":"knowledge","merged_into":null,"name":"Sequential Probability Ratio Test","name_zh":"序贯概率比检验","occurred_at":null,"props":{},"reviewed_at":"2026-11-10T08:39:06.102507+00:00","slug":"sequential-probability-ratio-test","status":"active","summary":"边收集数据边计算似然比、证据一够就停止的序贯假设检验。","tracked_at":null,"updated_at":"2026-11-10T08:39:06.055611+00:00","updated_by_run":"r_20261110_3r2w5e","what":"每来一个观测就更新两个假设下的累积似然比，越过上界接受一方、越过下界接受另一方，否则继续采样。","why":"固定样本量的检验必须把样本收满，即使前几个样本已足够下结论。SPRT 让样本量随证据强弱自适应，在相同错误率下所需样本更少；它最早用于工业质量检验，如今也被用来让大模型的多次采样尽早停止。"},"relations":[{"confidence":0.75,"created_at":"2026-11-10T08:39:06.055611+00:00","dir":"out","id":"e_01m729rs520sykcsve","other_id":"n_01m5eh84ssz150zh89","other_kind":"method","other_layer":"knowledge","other_name":"Self-Consistency","other_name_zh":"自洽性解码","other_occurred_at":null,"other_slug":"self-consistency","other_summary":"采样多条推理路径并对最终答案投票的解码策略。","rationale":"ConSol 用 SPRT 在采样答案已足够一致时停止采样，用更少词元达到与自一致性相当的准确率。","sources":[{"quote":null,"title":"ConSol: Sequential Probability Ratio Testing to Find Consistent LLM Reasoning Paths Efficiently","url":"https://arxiv.org/abs/2503.17587"}],"type